WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.220 --> 00:00:05.981
First, give a computer a fixed energy budget upfront, and get the best answer inside that limit.

2
00:00:06.321 --> 00:00:13.375
Second, a tiny food tag can refuse routine radio chatter in freezing cargo so safety alerts survive.

3
00:00:13.715 --> 00:00:19.976
Third, a data center can obey power-grid caps by pausing flexible work without giving wrong answers.
